================================================================================
SYNTHETIC CONTENT
================================================================================

All incident content in this product is synthetic. Organisations, people,
hostnames, addresses, file hashes and email content in content/scenarios/ are
invented. IP addresses are drawn from the RFC 5737 documentation ranges
(192.0.2.0/24, 198.51.100.0/24, 203.0.113.0/24) or RFC 1918 private space, and
domain names use RFC 2606 reserved TLDs, so none of it resolves or routes.

This is enforced mechanically rather than by convention:
`npm run content:validate` scans every content file and fails the build on any
address or hostname that could refer to real infrastructure. See
src/lib/content/safety.ts.

Any resemblance to a real institution, person or system is coincidental.
